        "text": "CEC resolution No. 20-25 of 19 June 1991 takes note of chairman V. I. Kazakov's report on the results of the election of the President of the RSFSR, approves the text of the CEC communication on the results and orders the communication published through TASS in the republican and local press; signed by V. Kazakov (chairman) and V. Prozorov (secretary).",
