        "attested_on": "1991-06-19",
        "uncertainty": "The TASS publication date is not given; that publication is the 'official announcement' from which Article 1 of Law 1494-I counts one month. The archival leaf is unconfirmed: the exhibit caption gives GARF F. 10026, Op. 8, D. 204, L. 6-7 and captions the three images L. 6, L. 6 ob. and L. 7, while the handwritten folio numbers on the images read 5, 6 and 7."
